async function posterBlob(index=current){const source=viewerMode==='fofitos'?fofitosPosts[index].src:posters[index].src;try{const response=await fetch(source);if(response.ok)return await response.blob()}catch(error){}const image=new Image();image.src=source;await image.decode();const canvas=document.createElement('canvas');canvas.width=image.naturalWidth;canvas.height=image.naturalHeight;canvas.getContext('2d').drawImage(image,0,0);return await new Promise((resolve,reject)=>{try{canvas.toBlob(blob=>blob?resolve(blob):reject(new Error('Image conversion failed')),'image/png')}catch(error){reject(error)}})}
async function downloadPoster(index=current){const blob=await posterBlob(index),url=URL.createObjectURL(blob),link=document.createElement('a');link.href=url;link.download=viewerMode==='fofitos'?`fofitos-post-${String(index+1).padStart(2,'0')}.png`:`doctor-farmer-post-${String(index+1).padStart(2,'0')}.png`;document.body.append(link);link.click();link.remove();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(url),1000)}
function setActionLabel(button,label){if(button===copyCaptionButton)button.lastChild.textContent=` ${label}`;else button.innerHTML=`<span aria-hidden="true">⇩</span> ${label}`}
async function copyCaption(index=current,button=copyCaptionButton){current=index;const text=completeCaption(index);setActionLabel(button,'Preparing…');button.disabled=true;let copied=false,downloaded=false;try{if(navigator.clipboard&&window.isSecureContext){await navigator.clipboard.writeText(text)}else{const area=document.createElement('textarea');area.value=text;area.setAttribute('readonly','');area.style.cssText='position:fixed;opacity:0;pointer-events:none';document.body.append(area);area.select();if(!document.execCommand('copy'))throw new Error('Copy failed');area.remove()}copied=true}catch(error){}try{await downloadPoster(index);downloaded=true}catch(error){}if(copied&&downloaded){button.classList.add('copied');setActionLabel(button,'Copied + downloaded!')}else if(copied){setActionLabel(button,'Copied · download blocked')}else if(downloaded){setActionLabel(button,'Downloaded · copy blocked')}else{setActionLabel(button,'Browser blocked both')}setTimeout(()=>{button.classList.remove('copied');button.disabled=false;setActionLabel(button,button===copyCaptionButton?'Copy + download':'Download + copy')},2600)}
